{"id":"n74128-1-7","stage":1,"title":"호랑이 · 老虎","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74128-1-7-1","ko":"할머니, 옛날 이야기 해 주세요.","zh":"奶奶，请给我讲讲古老的故事吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할머니,","meaning":"奶奶","explanation":"할머니：奶奶。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"2","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}},{"text":"옛날","meaning":"过去，昔日","explanation":"옛날：过去，昔日。","readings":[{"term":"옛날","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57273","senseId":"2","lemma":"옛날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옛날","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기","meaning":"故事","explanation":"이야기：故事。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"1","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"(亲近)用于指称或称呼年老的女性。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"336963582ab921f0","term":"옛날"